# schedule-docs

Docs + ODF freezes for CIS/WMR **schedule tiles**. Not an application codebase.

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `docs/common/schedule-tile-common.md` | Shared tile rules (baseline) |
| `docs/{DISC}/schedule-tile-requirements.md` | Discipline delta pack |
| `docs/grouping/` | Grouping CSV + README |
| `openspec/` | Backend grouping OpenSpec + change proposals |
| `ownScenarios/{DISC}/` | Playback freezes (XML + README + AC.feature) |
| `rawData/{DISC}/` | Source ODF dumps — **read-only** |

## Language & output

- Requirements / specs / freeze READMEs: **English**
- Do **not** generate BE/FE application code unless the user explicitly asks
- Prefer markdown packs, CSV, OpenSpec, and ODF XML under `ownScenarios/`

## Sources of truth (do not invent)

1. OSRP / ORIS / Common Codes / ODF verifier MCP — cite **document versions on the first line** of replies
2. Local packs + `schedule-tile-common.md` + grouping CSV
3. When sources conflict or under-specify → **Open product questions** (do not silently invent product answers)

## Commands

- `/define-requirements {DISC}` — write discipline pack
- `/build-simulation {DISC}` — build freeze from pack + `rawData`

Default edition: **LA28 / OG2028** unless overridden.
